       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Andrew Woods",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "From ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "accessLevel": "",
           "id": "6089a48d248ef60073948d92",
           "text": "@Unknown"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": ": This is should just be a matter of filtering out any messages where the org.fcrepo.jms.identifier header starts with /audit (or whatever FEDORA_AUDIT_LOCATION has been set to)",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "That would only involve adding a filter(simple(...)) clause in the AuditFcrepoRouter route. It should be only one line of code in the EventRouter class: ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/audit-triplestore/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/camel/audit/triplestore/EventRouter.java#L46"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/audit-triplestore/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/camel/audit/triplestore/EventRouter.java#L46",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "(see this for inspiration: ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/indexing-solr/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/camel/indexing/solr/EventRouter.java#L77)"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/indexing-solr/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/camel/indexing/solr/EventRouter.java#L77)",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "And updates to two configuration files: ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/audit-triplestore/src/main/resources/OSGI-INF/blueprint/blueprint.xml#L18"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/audit-triplestore/src/main/resources/OSGI-INF/blueprint/blueprint.xml#L18",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "and ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/audit-triplestore-web/src/main/resources/application.properties"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/audit-triplestore-web/src/main/resources/application.properties",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Along with corresponding updates to the two README files, identifying the configuration option.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
