       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Andrew Woods",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>From <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a48d248ef60073948d92\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a48d248ef60073948d92\" data-account-id=\"6089a48d248ef60073948d92\" accountid=\"6089a48d248ef60073948d92\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Unknown</a>: This is should just be a matter of filtering out any messages where the org.fcrepo.jms.identifier header starts with /audit (or whatever FEDORA_AUDIT_LOCATION has been set to)</p>\n\n<p>That would only involve adding a filter(simple(...)) clause in the AuditFcrepoRouter route. It should be only one line of code in the EventRouter class: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/audit-triplestore/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/camel/audit/triplestore/EventRouter.java#L46\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/audit-triplestore/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/camel/audit/triplestore/EventRouter.java#L46</a></p>\n\n<p>(see this for inspiration: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/indexing-solr/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/camel/indexing/solr/EventRouter.java#L77\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/indexing-solr/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/camel/indexing/solr/EventRouter.java#L77</a>)</p>\n\n<p>And updates to two configuration files: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/audit-triplestore/src/main/resources/OSGI-INF/blueprint/blueprint.xml#L18\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/audit-triplestore/src/main/resources/OSGI-INF/blueprint/blueprint.xml#L18</a><br/>\nand <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/audit-triplestore-web/src/main/resources/application.properties\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/audit-triplestore-web/src/main/resources/application.properties</a></p>\n\n<p>Along with corresponding updates to the two README files, identifying the configuration option.</p>",
