  "description": "<p>When both fcrepo-audit and audit-triplestore are enabled, two extra events are created for each event:</p>\n\n<p>1. The event for the creation of the audit node created by fcrepo-audit<br/>\n2. The event for the audit container lastModified being updated</p>\n\n<p>InternalAuditor has some logic to ignore these updates:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-audit/blob/master/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/audit/InternalAuditor.java#L157\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-audit/blob/master/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/audit/InternalAuditor.java#L157</a></p>\n\n<p>audit-triplestore should ignore these too.</p>",
